      "title": "Select one adjacent span",
      "explanation": "The original order is red, birds, sing, near, home. Selecting birds and sing produces one span because the removed tokens are adjacent. This constructed example uses two removed tokens out of five to make the transformation legible; the final T5 training recipe uses a 15% corruption rate and mean span length 3. Span count and removed-token count are different quantities.",
