      "title": "Build the ordered missing-text target",
      "explanation": "The decoder target is S0, birds, sing, S1. S0 introduces the missing span; birds and sing keep their original order; the next sentinel S1 closes the target after the final span. The target also has four tokens: two removed words, one span marker and one final marker. Visible input words are not repeated in the target. Training predicts this target autoregressively from the corrupted input.",
